      "text": "\n\nThe orange can landed **outside** the ashcan (to its right, at ~335,410) — a placement miss. Per the directive: ignore a can left outside after a miss, don't re-queue it. Right arm is already stowed open. Deactivating the place skill and returning to baseline to work the third can.\n\n"
